   <string>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;About LeoCAD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;View the LeoCAD version and system information. The Qt and OpenGL details can help diagnose display problems. Select text in System Information to copy it when reporting a problem. The website link opens in your browser.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
